{"parse": {"title": "FG-04", "pageid": 23015, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FG-03\" title=\"FG-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FG-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/FG-05\" title=\"FG-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.81.B0.E5.B0.98.E6.98.9F.E5.AD.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灰尘星子\">灰尘星子</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 灰尘星子</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Good News, Bad News</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>平<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>闪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>光<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191904</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-305410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>所以，谁来解释一下刚才到底发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直至夜色笼罩在大地上，他们才终于停下追逐的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜汪。<br />&lt;是的，我们还是没找到。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗感到可惜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>好吧，不管你们刚才发生了什么，不要担心，不要着急。朋友们，这只是一次非常常规的挫折。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>不过天色已经这么晚了，你们考虑好要在哪里过夜了吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜笼罩大地，喧闹的人声也一同被藏匿起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窸窣间，环状水星发现皮克勒斯还未入睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我看到你还背了一本书来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗从书本间抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，呜汪。<br />&lt;我希望自己能够在一段时间内结束关于《理解媒介》的阅读。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……狺……&lt;我发现人类社会的媒介在短时间内发生了巨大的变化，这本书能帮助我更好地了解这一切的内在原因。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>听上去你在阐述着一些非常深奥的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>很可惜，我可能不适合成为你的哲学伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<br />&lt;没有关系。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗表示不介意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪汪汪。<br />&lt;“媒介即讯息”，不同个体之间的交往本身就具有意义。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看着皮克勒斯脚下压着的书，环状水星似乎陷入了短暂的思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>比起旅行，你看上去似乎更爱读书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<br />&lt;是的。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>如果对旅程感到疲乏，我们也是能选择继续旅程或是打道回府的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>事实上，这趟旅途越往后走，我越感到这份差事不如想象中容易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>有的时候，也不是每一趟旅程都需要走到一个如期的终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯抬起头，甩了甩尾巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……呜汪……<br />&lt;噢，我似乎了解了您的意思。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪？<br />&lt;那您呢，您是怎么想的？&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗在询问你的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星看向远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>三明治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>“断指”是街上第一个给我一口吃食的人，在我的十二岁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>一开始并不是易事。流浪的途中最先消耗的，就是食物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>所以我始终感激他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗眨了眨眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜——<br />&lt;我理解了。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪汪汪。&lt;您也是个愿意报恩、愿意为朋友两肋插刀的人。这在犬类中也是非常常见却美好的品格。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，吽——汪。<br />&lt;既然如此，就像一开始答应过您的那样，我愿意同您继续这趟旅行。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗对你表示支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，汪，狺狺……<br />&lt;或许有些答案，只能在亲历的旅程中获得。&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星伸出手，和皮克勒斯郑重地握了握爪子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiankongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiankongshi\"><img alt=\"jiankongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/600px-Cg-jiankongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/900px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>当地时间凌晨五点，整个城市都陷入熟睡，包括本故事里的两位主人公，他们正在温暖的小帐篷里熟睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>一个持枪的黑影鬼鬼祟祟闯入帐篷，一分钟后，他蹑手蹑脚地抱着只狗出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>具体过程，在本台记者ONiON采访了两位当事人之后，获得了全部面貌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>——现在向您播报出来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呼噜噜噜……呼噜噜噜噜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嘘——嘘——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>唔？——唔！呜呜呜——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>啧，嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜呜……呜呜呜呜……！呜呜……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiankongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiankongshi\"><img alt=\"jiankongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/600px-Cg-jiankongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/900px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>边境牧羊犬。全球犬类中最聪明的种类之一，难逃医用催眠枪的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-305401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>好，我们回到故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……呃。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星从睡梦中缓缓睁开眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-309501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>——嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-309513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-309513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-309513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>——皮克勒斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有回应,身旁空空如也。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>——咳——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……呼、呼……呼、呼！——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>在哪里……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-309514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>皮克勒斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-309513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-309513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-309513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……皮——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然，一抹微光出现在她的感知领域中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她悄悄溯源而去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着长草折断于脚底的清脆声，她拨开一块石头旁边的枯叶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-309511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-309511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-309511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……嘿——原来你在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗中，一双小眼睛闪着狡黠的光芒，正透过石头缝盯着环状水星。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FG-04"}}